OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with patchy light rain
OL,6,Fspreading southeast through the
OL,7,Fmorning. Then turning drier and
OL,8,Fbrighter for a time into the afternoon
OL,9,Fbefore increasing amounts of cloud
OL,10,Fagain later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAt first a mainly dry but
OL,13,Frather cloudy evening. Cloud becomes
OL,14,Fextensive overnight, thickening to
OL,15,Fgive little rain or drizzle at times,
OL,16,Fperhaps briefly heavy in the north.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA fairly cloudy day with some
OL,19,Fbright spells between a few scattered
OL,20,Fshowers. Brisk winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
